WEBVTT

00:42.042 --> 00:45.963
MY ROYAL NEMESIS

00:53.387 --> 00:54.388
Here we go.

00:59.935 --> 01:01.562
Try a little harder this time.

01:01.645 --> 01:03.188
At this rate, I will win again.

01:03.272 --> 01:05.440
Please take it easy, Your Highness.

01:05.524 --> 01:07.234
We do not want a stray arrow to ruin

01:07.317 --> 01:08.694
all the beautiful peonies.

01:08.777 --> 01:10.988
-Do you find them beautiful as well?
-Yes.

01:11.071 --> 01:14.157
I was right to clear the patch
and plant peonies.

01:14.241 --> 01:15.826
When it comes to flowers,

01:15.909 --> 01:19.079
they need big heads like this
to be worth looking at.

01:20.455 --> 01:23.125
A peony, beaded with dewdrops
like pearls, was plucked…

01:24.626 --> 01:26.587
by a beauty as she passed a window.

01:31.800 --> 01:33.594
With a smile, she asks her beloved,

01:34.094 --> 01:35.721
"Which is fairer, the flower or I?"

01:35.804 --> 01:37.889
The young lord answers
in gentle mischief.

01:39.057 --> 01:40.225
"The flower is far fairer."

01:40.309 --> 01:43.353
I, too, find the peonies
more beautiful than Your Majesty.

01:46.315 --> 01:48.775
I can never win against you.

01:48.859 --> 01:52.237
No flower in the world could be
as beautiful as you.

01:53.488 --> 01:54.406
Your Majesty.

01:54.489 --> 01:56.074
It is time for your midday meal.

01:56.158 --> 01:58.869
What brings you all the way to the Annex?

01:58.952 --> 02:00.078
I have

02:00.704 --> 02:02.873
a gift for you.

02:08.920 --> 02:11.048
Your Majesty, what is this?

02:11.131 --> 02:13.258
Your health seems
to have declined of late.

02:13.342 --> 02:17.012
I personally asked the Royal Infirmary
to concoct you a restorative tonic.

02:21.725 --> 02:23.060
A restorative tonic…

02:24.728 --> 02:26.980
Royal Consort Hui of the Kang clan
shall accept the poison.

02:30.859 --> 02:33.278
Royal Consort Hui,
what is the meaning of this?

02:34.321 --> 02:37.658
Your Majesty, please take the tonic away.

02:38.325 --> 02:39.576
I cannot stand

02:40.327 --> 02:42.412
even the smell of tonic.

03:10.273 --> 03:12.275
Hey, Ms. Shin Seo-ri.

03:13.068 --> 03:15.320
Ms. Shin Seo-ri, wake up.

03:15.404 --> 03:16.780
The shock must've been too much.

03:16.863 --> 03:18.115
I'll call an ambulance.

03:18.198 --> 03:20.534
No, this isn't
just another minor fender bender.

03:20.617 --> 03:21.827
The media may exploit this.

03:21.910 --> 03:23.537
-Call Dr. Kim.
-Yes, sir.

03:25.872 --> 03:26.748
Wait.

03:32.045 --> 03:33.588
Ms. Shin, are you awake?

03:47.477 --> 03:50.564
EPISODE 2
A GUIDE TO OPTIMIZING YOUR FATE

03:57.237 --> 04:00.282
Given that he resides
in such lofty chambers,

04:00.365 --> 04:02.909
he must be
at least a high-ranking minister.

04:03.618 --> 04:05.078
He has the pedigree, influence,

04:05.162 --> 04:06.788
and even that handsome face.

04:06.872 --> 04:08.498
He truly has it all.

04:08.582 --> 04:09.750
How did you know

04:10.584 --> 04:12.377
a mannequin would fall from the sky?

04:12.461 --> 04:13.420
I just knew.

04:13.503 --> 04:16.214
My instincts in that sphere
are exceptionally keen.

04:25.682 --> 04:26.683
Damn it.

04:26.767 --> 04:28.185
Arrest that assassin at once!

04:37.194 --> 04:38.695
What are you waiting for?

04:38.779 --> 04:40.155
Seize her this instant!

04:45.786 --> 04:48.121
Take him into custody immediately!

04:48.205 --> 04:50.207
I am endowed
with a remarkably keen sixth sense.

04:50.290 --> 04:52.417
It has allowed me to survive
countless attempts

04:52.501 --> 04:53.752
of poisoning and assassination.

04:54.753 --> 04:57.881
Thanks to me, you have preserved
your precious life.

05:00.383 --> 05:01.718
Don't tell me.

05:02.719 --> 05:04.137
Were you in on it?

05:06.890 --> 05:09.226
Are you implying I am involved
with those schemers

05:09.309 --> 05:11.311
who lower themselves to using assassins?

05:12.103 --> 05:13.396
I never scheme from the shadows.

05:13.480 --> 05:15.357
I strike necks openly.

05:15.440 --> 05:17.901
So you're not one of them,
but you just happened to pass out

05:17.984 --> 05:20.070
in front of my car and save me today?

05:20.153 --> 05:21.696
I think I get the gist of it.

05:21.780 --> 05:25.158
I'll have Mr. Son compensate you
for your troubles. You may leave now.

05:26.117 --> 05:27.661
Now, hold on.

05:28.328 --> 05:31.331
Do you take me for some beggar,
groveling for scraps?

05:33.416 --> 05:35.544
You are not as perceptive as you appear.

05:36.169 --> 05:38.547
I have something
that you desperately need.

05:38.630 --> 05:42.342
Hence, I was going to give you
the chance to make a deal with me.

05:45.512 --> 05:47.222
You want to make a deal with me?

05:47.305 --> 05:50.600
Even with all these subordinates
at your feet, your life hangs by a thread.

05:50.684 --> 05:53.395
What use are absolute power
and worldly riches?

05:53.478 --> 05:54.729
Before a fleeting life,

05:55.313 --> 05:57.858
even the supreme sovereign's throne
is but vanity.

06:00.861 --> 06:01.945
I shall safeguard

06:02.445 --> 06:04.906
the flickering flame you call your life.

06:05.907 --> 06:07.284
Keep me by your side.

06:11.830 --> 06:13.123
Unhand me at once!

06:13.206 --> 06:14.708
Do you know who I am?

06:16.960 --> 06:18.295
Unhand me!

06:19.129 --> 06:20.380
Damn it.

06:20.463 --> 06:22.591
How can you be
such a poor judge of character?

06:22.716 --> 06:25.260
That pretty face has you
with your nose high in the air.

06:25.343 --> 06:28.054
You deserve to be struck down
by lightning from the heavens above.

06:28.138 --> 06:29.014
That's pretty harsh.

06:29.097 --> 06:31.892
You would curse someone
who was just senselessly attacked?

06:31.975 --> 06:33.310
I know Mr. Cha

06:33.393 --> 06:35.854
can be a bit unreasonable at times,
but please bear with him.

06:35.937 --> 06:38.857
Yes. He certainly is
an impulsive fool through and through.

06:39.357 --> 06:40.984
Working for him must be torture.

06:42.027 --> 06:44.195
Let's go, Ms. Shin. I'll take you home.

06:47.157 --> 06:48.533
In this moving palanquin?

06:48.617 --> 06:50.327
Hear me!

06:52.162 --> 06:53.163
Shall we?

06:58.585 --> 07:01.713
Mr. Cha, this is
the CCTV footage from the scene.

07:03.381 --> 07:04.591
Why would they do this?

07:06.176 --> 07:07.844
I thought it had already been handled.

07:07.928 --> 07:09.012
Sir,

07:09.095 --> 07:10.639
about that protester from earlier--

07:10.722 --> 07:12.140
Can it wait?

07:12.223 --> 07:13.391
I need to make a call.

07:13.475 --> 07:14.684
Yes, sir.

07:15.810 --> 07:16.686
Mr. Son.

07:17.479 --> 07:19.356
Let's just handle the guy
from the lobby earlier.

07:19.439 --> 07:20.607
How exactly?

07:22.275 --> 07:24.361
You said it was about unpaid wages.

07:24.444 --> 07:25.820
Just resolve it for them.

07:27.489 --> 07:29.240
Is there someone behind the scenes?

07:29.824 --> 07:31.159
Any guesses on the motive?

07:31.826 --> 07:33.286
I assume it's money.

07:33.370 --> 07:36.331
They attacked even after they were paid
what they were owed.

07:37.040 --> 07:38.750
There's a bigger payout somewhere.

07:46.591 --> 07:49.260
He just slammed the door in my face
as if I were some assassin.

07:49.344 --> 07:50.679
What is he scheming now?

07:50.762 --> 07:52.347
Is he having me watched? Is that it?

07:52.430 --> 07:53.974
No, not at all.

07:54.057 --> 07:55.225
Mr. Cha was worried about you.

07:55.308 --> 07:57.978
He asked me to make sure
you got home safely.

07:59.562 --> 08:01.022
He was worried about me?

08:01.106 --> 08:03.316
When I reviewed your profile,
I noticed you lived nearby.

08:03.400 --> 08:05.902
I mean, you were almost
in a car accident earlier.

08:05.986 --> 08:06.987
And had the audition too.

08:07.070 --> 08:09.906
You've been through a lot today,
so he was concerned.

08:11.658 --> 08:13.034
In this desolate world,

08:13.702 --> 08:15.704
I guess I have someone
who worries about me.

08:15.787 --> 08:18.206
Too bad he is the cause of my distress.

08:21.126 --> 08:22.460
Ms. Shin, are you okay?

08:22.544 --> 08:24.295
You look a little pale.

08:24.379 --> 08:26.548
Well, actually,

08:26.631 --> 08:29.426
I have wanted to ask you this
for some time now.

08:29.509 --> 08:31.344
Could you slow down a bit?

08:31.428 --> 08:33.596
This palanquin is moving way too fast.

08:33.680 --> 08:34.806
It is making me very dizzy.

08:39.185 --> 08:41.563
But we're only going
20km an hour right now.

08:46.276 --> 08:47.318
In all my life,

08:47.402 --> 08:49.988
I have never been in a palanquin
that went this fast.

09:01.124 --> 09:02.292
Father.

09:02.375 --> 09:03.585
Is this seafood stew?

09:04.085 --> 09:05.295
Seafood herbal chicken stew.

09:05.378 --> 09:08.548
Made with 100% wild-caught abalone.

09:08.631 --> 09:11.051
I took the first flight to Jeju Island
at the crack of dawn

09:11.134 --> 09:12.761
just to get this for you.

09:12.844 --> 09:15.096
-I didn't sleep a wink.
-You can be so silly.

09:15.180 --> 09:16.389
Did you already forget

09:16.473 --> 09:19.100
that Father caught that awful norovirus
from eating raw oysters

09:19.184 --> 09:21.061
at his birthday last year?

09:21.144 --> 09:22.479
You know he has a weak stomach.

09:27.108 --> 09:28.902
What hearty roots.

09:28.985 --> 09:30.862
Abalones are so basic.

09:31.488 --> 09:33.656
You should have one before the meal.

09:33.740 --> 09:35.992
It's genuine wild ginseng harvested
by a ginseng forager

09:36.076 --> 09:37.285
on Mount Jiri.

09:37.368 --> 09:39.079
It has a nice bitterness to it.

09:39.829 --> 09:41.331
That's the real deal.

09:42.415 --> 09:43.958
I can't compete with you two.

09:44.042 --> 09:46.544
Next time you prepare a gift for Uncle,

09:46.628 --> 09:47.796
can you include me?

09:47.879 --> 09:49.214
Sure thing, Mun-do.

09:49.297 --> 09:50.924
It's a bit rude to show up empty-handed

09:51.007 --> 09:52.467
to your uncle's birthday party, no?

09:52.550 --> 09:54.302
Don't talk to Mun-do about manners.

09:54.385 --> 09:57.138
Ten kids don't compare
to one good nephew.

09:57.222 --> 09:59.224
Here we go again.

09:59.307 --> 10:00.725
That damn liver story.

10:00.809 --> 10:04.145
17 YEARS AGO

10:04.229 --> 10:07.398
All right, who's going to give me a liver?

10:07.482 --> 10:09.818
If it weren't for this godforsaken asthma,

10:09.901 --> 10:13.488
I would gladly give you as many pieces
of my liver as you wanted.

10:15.532 --> 10:17.742
If I just weren't breastfeeding the kids,

10:18.284 --> 10:20.995
I would gladly chop mine off for you.

10:21.663 --> 10:23.456
I'll give you mine, Uncle.

10:31.589 --> 10:34.926
While my perfectly healthy kids
turned their backs on me,

10:35.009 --> 10:37.053
my nephew gave me a second chance at life.

10:37.137 --> 10:40.223
And you brats can't even show
gratitude to your father's savior.

10:40.306 --> 10:41.516
Uncle, please stop.

10:41.599 --> 10:43.852
Se-gye was too young back then,

10:43.935 --> 10:46.479
and the rest all had valid reasons.

10:46.563 --> 10:48.565
All I had to offer was my health anyway.

10:48.648 --> 10:51.025
Yes, I'm only alive
because of you, Mun-do.

10:51.109 --> 10:52.569
What a shame.

10:52.652 --> 10:56.030
How nice it would be if Se-gye
were even half the man you are.

11:12.088 --> 11:14.591
DAEBAK BOARDING HOUSE

11:15.258 --> 11:17.969
It appears I still had
surprises waiting for me.

11:18.553 --> 11:21.598
Mr. Cha insisted
that you get checked out by a doctor.

11:21.681 --> 11:23.600
The aftereffects of a car accident
really get you.

11:23.683 --> 11:25.018
Make sure you go tomorrow.

11:32.150 --> 11:34.527
After rebuffing me so harshly to my face…

11:35.570 --> 11:38.198
He certainly is a man
riddled with contradictions.

11:47.081 --> 11:50.043
What a destitute life this woman leads.

11:50.710 --> 11:52.128
You call this a house?

11:55.465 --> 11:56.799
I have arrived!

11:57.383 --> 11:58.927
Look at that freak. She must be wasted.

11:59.010 --> 12:01.137
Like she's a noblewoman or something?

12:01.221 --> 12:02.305
-I know, right?
-Hey…

12:02.889 --> 12:04.390
I have arrived!

12:04.474 --> 12:05.475
Is anybody in there?

12:06.351 --> 12:08.770
My word. Is this any way to treat
the master of the house?

12:08.853 --> 12:10.563
What is the gatekeeper even doing?

12:14.025 --> 12:15.401
That light turned on by itself.

12:22.450 --> 12:23.409
Hold on…

12:24.911 --> 12:26.454
I need to gather my wits about me.

12:26.537 --> 12:29.582
Keep your wits about you,
and you can survive even a tiger's den.

12:29.666 --> 12:31.918
"With a focused mind,
nothing is impossible."

12:34.295 --> 12:35.380
Unit 203!

12:36.047 --> 12:38.800
Where have you been?
Why are you getting back so late?

12:38.883 --> 12:40.385
And why is your phone off?

12:40.468 --> 12:43.513
Hurry upstairs. Your grandmother
has been waiting for ages.

12:43.596 --> 12:45.056
Just to see your face.

12:45.139 --> 12:46.140
Grandmother?

12:52.855 --> 12:54.065
My goodness.

12:56.484 --> 12:57.944
There's my little girl.

12:59.153 --> 13:00.613
Come and sit down.

13:02.365 --> 13:03.616
Sit. Go on.

13:04.117 --> 13:06.786
You didn't even have time to change?
What is all this?

13:12.667 --> 13:13.668
All right.

13:13.751 --> 13:15.461
Here. Try this.

13:15.545 --> 13:18.047
I made your favorites.
Japchae and pork cutlets.

13:18.131 --> 13:20.049
I even made candied sweet potatoes.

13:23.511 --> 13:25.555
Come to think of it,
I have not eaten all day.

13:25.638 --> 13:26.723
I fried them myself.

13:32.729 --> 13:34.147
They say a person's hands

13:34.772 --> 13:36.649
reveal the life they have lived.

13:37.275 --> 13:39.027
Why do you look so worn out?

13:39.527 --> 13:41.362
It seems this woman's grandmother

13:41.446 --> 13:43.323
did not have an easy life either.

13:43.406 --> 13:45.408
Did work keep you from eating again?

13:46.034 --> 13:47.410
Hurry up and eat.

13:48.036 --> 13:49.912
Here, take these and eat.

13:51.205 --> 13:53.374
Oh right.
You should join us for a bite too.

13:53.458 --> 13:56.419
-Really? Yes. Thank you so much.
-Sure.

13:57.587 --> 13:58.629
Thank you.

14:11.559 --> 14:13.686
Silly me. How could I be so forgetful?

14:13.770 --> 14:16.564
I'm on this herbal supplement, you see.

14:16.647 --> 14:19.108
So I don't think
I should be eating all this meat.

14:19.192 --> 14:20.401
But there's no meat in this.

14:20.485 --> 14:21.944
No, I'm fine. Really.

14:22.487 --> 14:24.405
Enjoy your meal, Unit 203.

14:24.989 --> 14:26.574
-Excuse me.
-Sure.

14:29.660 --> 14:30.703
Goodness.

14:34.874 --> 14:35.833
Here.

14:36.376 --> 14:38.961
Don't share this with anyone.

14:39.045 --> 14:42.382
Hide it in a corner somewhere
and eat it all by yourself. Got it?

14:42.465 --> 14:45.134
This isn't pork. It's beef.
High-quality Korean beef.

14:45.218 --> 14:46.344
See. Korean beef.

15:00.942 --> 15:02.777
Is it good? Do you like it?

15:02.860 --> 15:05.863
You know, I've been messing up
the seasoning lately.

15:05.947 --> 15:07.657
I put extra effort into this one.

15:08.991 --> 15:10.118
It is quite delicious.

15:10.201 --> 15:11.577
Really?

15:11.661 --> 15:12.912
Gosh.

15:12.995 --> 15:14.414
Great. Go on.

15:14.497 --> 15:15.540
Eat up.

15:15.623 --> 15:18.042
Go on now. Have some japchae too.

15:22.630 --> 15:24.257
Have some more.

15:26.300 --> 15:27.802
You must have been starving.

15:34.267 --> 15:37.103
How nice it is to have
everyone gather for a meal like this.

15:37.186 --> 15:39.730
Asking the family to gather
for a measly meal on my birthday

15:39.814 --> 15:41.482
is not asking for the moon.

15:41.566 --> 15:45.319
And yet, I don't even know
if the one grandson I have will show up.

15:45.987 --> 15:47.363
Father, you saw the news, right?

15:47.447 --> 15:49.824
I mean, he is way too old
to be acting out like that.

15:49.907 --> 15:51.951
I guess he still can't control
that temper of his.

15:52.034 --> 15:53.327
They say the video was doctored.

15:53.411 --> 15:55.121
Looks like someone was messing with him.

15:55.204 --> 15:57.582
He's probably late
cleaning up that mess, Uncle.

15:58.207 --> 16:00.585
You sure know everything, don't you?

16:00.668 --> 16:03.713
Fake or not, he should've
just behaved himself all along.

16:03.796 --> 16:05.214
With that kind of reputation,

16:05.298 --> 16:08.342
people will believe anything,
no matter how outlandish or tawdry.

16:08.426 --> 16:09.760
Don't you agree, Father?

16:09.844 --> 16:11.345
Why that little…

16:22.607 --> 16:24.358
Happy birthday, Grandfather.

16:24.442 --> 16:25.943
Sorry I'm late. Car trouble.

16:26.027 --> 16:28.112
You should've planned ahead for that.

16:28.196 --> 16:30.281
A businessman should be able
to manage his time.

16:30.364 --> 16:33.075
I knew the party would start
with the usual catfight

16:33.159 --> 16:36.579
and shameless displays of loyalty.
Neither of which I can stomach.

16:36.662 --> 16:38.831
So I timed my arrival to avoid it.

16:38.915 --> 16:39.874
Is it still going?

16:39.957 --> 16:41.167
You rotten scoundrel.

16:41.250 --> 16:42.335
Even at a birthday party,

16:42.418 --> 16:44.921
you can't keep that trap of yours shut?

16:45.004 --> 16:48.007
Please try to calm down, Uncle.
It's your birthday, after all.

16:50.092 --> 16:51.093
Welcome, Se-gye.

16:56.182 --> 16:57.141
Cheers.

16:58.726 --> 17:00.144
Sir, the CCTV footage

17:00.228 --> 17:04.232
from the rear entrance confirms
the attacker fled in a nearby getaway car.

17:04.315 --> 17:06.943
It was parked too far away
for the cameras to catch the plate.

17:07.026 --> 17:08.194
Just as I expected.

17:09.612 --> 17:11.364
Which means it wasn't a random attack.

17:11.447 --> 17:14.242
Sir, we should request
a police investigation now.

17:14.325 --> 17:17.620
They timed their attack to coincide
with the buyer meeting and audition.

17:17.703 --> 17:20.748
It appears they were targeting
the "abusive CEO" image.

17:20.831 --> 17:21.791
That's why.

17:22.291 --> 17:24.460
The intent was underhanded
and premeditated.

17:25.419 --> 17:26.963
We can't just play into their hands.

17:27.046 --> 17:29.131
Is there someone you suspect?

17:29.215 --> 17:30.675
There's no shortage of people

17:31.300 --> 17:33.261
who want to see me crash and burn.

17:34.804 --> 17:35.972
I suppose you're right.

17:39.183 --> 17:41.727
They all treat me like a thief
raiding the family vault.

17:41.811 --> 17:43.563
The eldest aunt, the youngest aunt,

17:43.646 --> 17:45.481
and even the distant cousin.

17:47.567 --> 17:50.152
This place is crawling with fake smiles.

17:54.782 --> 17:55.950
Seo-ri.

17:56.033 --> 17:59.078
You're all alone in this strange place.

17:59.161 --> 18:00.580
It must be hard.

18:01.539 --> 18:03.082
I know how you feel.

18:05.042 --> 18:07.044
My restaurant is doing well.

18:07.128 --> 18:10.172
Stop worrying about me
and buy yourself some new clothes.

18:10.256 --> 18:12.425
No young lady should be dressed like this.

18:12.508 --> 18:15.303
You'll never land a fellow
looking like that.

18:15.386 --> 18:17.597
As if having one ever leads
to anything good.

18:21.100 --> 18:23.978
You grew up so lonely
without your parents' love.

18:24.937 --> 18:27.565
You should have at least one person
on your side in this world.

18:27.648 --> 18:30.860
But still, you grew up to be
such a fine young lady.

18:30.943 --> 18:32.403
You've done such a great job.

18:35.197 --> 18:36.699
I'm so proud of you.

18:39.076 --> 18:41.746
Are you proud of your granddaughter?

18:42.246 --> 18:43.247
Of course.

18:44.582 --> 18:47.585
You're so beautiful inside and out.

18:47.668 --> 18:49.670
In all my time on this earth,

18:49.754 --> 18:51.881
I've never met anyone like you.

18:55.343 --> 18:56.636
Hurry inside.

18:56.719 --> 18:57.803
I'll be going now.

18:58.888 --> 18:59.889
Go on.

19:12.818 --> 19:14.195
Go inside.

19:18.240 --> 19:19.367
Safe…

19:21.369 --> 19:22.787
travels.

19:36.842 --> 19:38.427
-Mr. Son.
-Yes, sir.

19:38.928 --> 19:41.305
Twice can't be a coincidence, right?

19:42.973 --> 19:44.016
Pardon?

19:44.850 --> 19:45.935
Think about it.

19:46.602 --> 19:49.105
She passed out in front of my car
when it was barely moving,

19:49.188 --> 19:51.607
and then she predicted
that attack like some sort of psychic.

19:51.691 --> 19:53.818
I looked into Ms. Shin Seo-ri.

19:54.318 --> 19:57.321
Besides her rude speech,
nothing else seemed suspicious.

19:57.405 --> 20:00.449
Surely you don't think
someone put her up to this?

20:00.533 --> 20:02.118
It never hurts to be careful.

20:02.910 --> 20:05.079
We've put everything on the line
for this brand launch,

20:05.162 --> 20:07.206
even shouldering private fund risk.

20:07.289 --> 20:09.625
We need to be
extra cautious right now.

20:11.127 --> 20:13.087
Double the security team for now,

20:13.713 --> 20:16.048
and personally double-check
all the HR files.

20:16.132 --> 20:17.133
Yes, sir.

20:18.843 --> 20:21.345
And find out
everything you can about her.

20:21.429 --> 20:22.471
Yes, sir.

20:43.868 --> 20:45.161
You call this a room?

20:46.370 --> 20:48.539
A prison cell would be more luxurious.

20:53.586 --> 20:54.628
What in the world…

20:55.129 --> 20:56.005
Look here.

20:56.088 --> 20:58.966
No window ought to command such a view.

20:59.049 --> 21:02.511
Seriously? Were you expecting
a view of Namsan Tower or something?

21:02.595 --> 21:04.597
Why are you complaining now?

21:04.680 --> 21:07.224
It's compact and great value.

21:07.308 --> 21:08.476
With ventilation, no less!

21:08.559 --> 21:10.644
I gave you our most popular room.

21:10.728 --> 21:12.772
You call this a room and collect rent?

21:12.855 --> 21:15.107
I have never encountered
such miserliness in my life.

21:15.191 --> 21:18.444
All the windowless rooms are taken now.

21:18.527 --> 21:20.362
You can move when one opens up.

21:21.071 --> 21:22.239
Wait.

21:22.323 --> 21:24.450
There are even rooms without windows?

21:24.533 --> 21:25.701
Unbelievable.

21:26.285 --> 21:27.453
I never!

21:29.038 --> 21:30.247
My goodness.

21:41.217 --> 21:42.384
Why, this scoundrel…

21:56.232 --> 21:57.650
Unit 203, open up!

21:57.733 --> 21:59.235
Open this door!

21:59.985 --> 22:01.028
Unbelievable.

22:01.111 --> 22:02.279
Who goes there?

22:02.363 --> 22:04.782
What sort of knave batters
a lady's door in the dead of night?

22:04.865 --> 22:06.492
"Knave"? Seriously?

22:06.575 --> 22:08.619
You know, I've tolerated
all your noise until now,

22:08.702 --> 22:10.037
but I can't take it anymore!

22:10.120 --> 22:13.082
You keep rustling around,
and you won't stop talking to yourself.

22:13.165 --> 22:14.291
I can't live like this.

22:14.375 --> 22:16.961
If you cannot live with that,
you should just leave.

22:17.545 --> 22:19.088
Have you lost your damn mind?

22:19.171 --> 22:21.465
Are you trying to start a fight with me?

22:21.549 --> 22:24.552
You can hear every burp
and fart from your neighbors here.

22:24.635 --> 22:27.513
Wouldn't it be common courtesy
to be a bit more careful?

22:27.596 --> 22:29.473
What the… Hold on.

22:29.557 --> 22:30.724
What's going on here?

22:30.808 --> 22:32.309
What's with all this racket?

22:32.393 --> 22:35.354
This man here is making
the most absurd complaints.

22:35.437 --> 22:37.857
He says not to burp
or fart too loudly in my own room.

22:37.940 --> 22:41.151
Why not just tell me
to stop breathing altogether?

22:41.235 --> 22:42.528
Unbelievable.

22:42.611 --> 22:44.530
You clearly missed the point.

22:44.613 --> 22:46.782
We are trapped in this prison together.

22:46.866 --> 22:48.868
If we cannot show a little grace

22:48.951 --> 22:50.911
and forgive small faults,

22:50.995 --> 22:53.247
how are we any different from beasts?

22:53.330 --> 22:54.290
"Beasts"?

22:54.373 --> 22:56.542
So are you saying
I'm some kind of savage now?

22:56.625 --> 22:58.085
Mencius said

22:58.168 --> 23:01.046
that a sense of shame and indignation
is the beginning of righteousness.

23:01.130 --> 23:04.258
You fail to see your own flaws
and only harp on others.

23:05.092 --> 23:08.137
Like a crap-covered dog
scolding a dusty dog.

23:08.220 --> 23:09.889
Crap dog? You calling me a mutt?

23:09.972 --> 23:12.016
-Hear, hear!
-Hear, hear!

23:12.099 --> 23:13.350
Who was that?

23:15.019 --> 23:17.730
I ought to wring your neck,
but it seems

23:17.813 --> 23:19.440
I have public sentiment on my side.

23:19.523 --> 23:21.525
So stop causing a scene and begone!

23:22.443 --> 23:24.486
My day has been long enough.

23:30.284 --> 23:32.620
She couldn't even look me
in the eye before.

23:32.703 --> 23:34.330
What's gotten into her?

23:50.179 --> 23:51.805
I just sensed an assassin's presence.

23:51.889 --> 23:54.183
Someone nearby is after your life!
Get down!

24:00.356 --> 24:01.774
Keep me by your side.

24:02.358 --> 24:05.486
I shall safeguard
the flickering flame you call your life.

24:05.569 --> 24:07.488
As if she could keep anyone safe.

24:18.540 --> 24:20.417
How truly marvelous.

24:21.585 --> 24:23.462
This is pure witchcraft.

24:26.757 --> 24:28.676
If you pull the string,

24:28.759 --> 24:30.761
it lights right up.

24:32.054 --> 24:33.722
How useful.

24:37.142 --> 24:39.061
You tell me to leave because I am useless?

24:39.144 --> 24:41.230
Do you think Court Lady Kim
took a bribe?

24:41.313 --> 24:44.233
I cannot understand
why she brought in someone like you.

24:44.316 --> 24:46.151
Who are you to decide my worth?

24:46.235 --> 24:48.362
Look at the venom in her eyes.

24:48.445 --> 24:50.572
Jumping into that river
must have been easy for you.

24:50.656 --> 24:52.992
I heard you ran away
after being sold into slavery.

24:53.075 --> 24:55.411
A lowly wench like you
should know her place.

24:55.494 --> 24:57.579
How could we ever share a room
with someone like you?

24:57.663 --> 24:59.123
-So vile.
-What did you say?

24:59.206 --> 25:00.332
Did you just call me vile?

25:00.416 --> 25:03.210
Looks like you grew up sheltered
and do not know any better.

25:03.293 --> 25:06.005
Allow me to show you
what something truly "vile" looks like.

25:08.507 --> 25:09.425
My goodness!

25:14.722 --> 25:16.974
Just try calling me vile again.

25:17.516 --> 25:19.226
I will pour it over your heads next time!

25:19.309 --> 25:20.769
Have you lost your damn mind?

25:23.355 --> 25:24.857
Grab her!

25:25.733 --> 25:27.735
Let go of me! You cannot be serious!

25:27.818 --> 25:29.778
The palace follows a set of laws.

25:29.862 --> 25:32.406
Even the Inner Court's lowest ranks
have a hierarchy.

25:32.489 --> 25:35.117
Let me give you a proper lesson
on those laws today.

25:35.200 --> 25:36.952
You two, drag her out.

25:38.120 --> 25:39.079
Let me go!

25:39.788 --> 25:40.914
Let me go!

25:51.550 --> 25:52.968
Let me out this instant!

25:53.052 --> 25:54.178
Let me out!

25:54.261 --> 25:55.637
Grab that rock.

25:58.599 --> 25:59.892
Let me out!

26:00.517 --> 26:01.560
Let me out!

26:13.238 --> 26:14.740
Why is she so quiet?

26:14.823 --> 26:18.160
I heard she was a little crazy.
What if something is wrong with her?

26:19.286 --> 26:21.580
Who cares? She deserves it.

26:21.663 --> 26:24.041
She should have just left
when we asked nicely.

26:25.793 --> 26:26.752
Let us go.

26:46.855 --> 26:49.274
Now I will not have to stay up
every night…

26:51.360 --> 26:53.153
tending the lamp.

26:56.615 --> 26:58.700
That scoundrel still has not come
to his senses.

26:58.784 --> 27:01.495
I should have snapped his wrists
when I had the chance.

27:04.498 --> 27:05.707
How will I ever

27:06.375 --> 27:08.877
get any sleep with all this commotion?

27:28.856 --> 27:33.026
YEONGHWI CHAMBER

27:50.544 --> 27:52.421
Please let me out!

28:24.828 --> 28:26.580
Just look at this household.

28:27.497 --> 28:31.251
Not so much as a piece of gold
or a simple jade ring to be found.

29:02.366 --> 29:03.575
I am an actor.

29:04.409 --> 29:06.036
A former child star

29:06.787 --> 29:08.789
who no one recognizes anymore.

29:10.457 --> 29:14.836
I'm just a nobody with no ties
to the mythical rise of K-dramas.

29:14.920 --> 29:16.588
Harder. One more.

29:16.672 --> 29:18.799
-Cut! Turn it around!
-Let's turn it around.

29:18.882 --> 29:21.510
Who is she?
Where did they even find her?

29:21.593 --> 29:23.387
-Let's clean this up.
-Okay.

29:24.763 --> 29:25.722
Hurry up.

29:25.806 --> 29:27.140
WE'RE ROOTING FOR YOUR DREAMS

29:27.266 --> 29:30.477
The world likes to admire dreamers…

29:30.560 --> 29:31.812
BALANCE: 164,019 WON

29:32.896 --> 29:35.983
…but even encouragement has its limits.

29:37.693 --> 29:41.238
FUNDS TO WIRE TO NAM OK-SUN
50,000 WON

29:43.907 --> 29:45.701
FUNDS TO WIRE TO NAM OK-SUN
100,000 WON

29:45.784 --> 29:46.660
TRANSACTION COMPLETED

29:50.122 --> 29:50.998
GRANDMA

29:53.583 --> 29:55.794
-Grandma.
-Hey, Seo-ri.

29:55.877 --> 29:57.546
I just sent you some money.

29:58.422 --> 30:01.425
So treat yourself to a nice meal.
Don't go asking around for scraps.

30:01.508 --> 30:04.803
Gosh, I'm just an old lady.
I wouldn't even know where to spend it.

30:04.886 --> 30:06.471
Hey, keep it down!

30:06.555 --> 30:07.848
What was that noise?

30:07.931 --> 30:09.308
Are you with someone?

30:09.391 --> 30:11.101
No. That's just the TV.

30:12.811 --> 30:15.355
You've got great hearing.
How did you even hear that?

30:15.439 --> 30:17.357
My eyes and ears still work just fine.

30:17.441 --> 30:20.235
I have to stay healthy
if I want to see you on TV.

30:20.319 --> 30:23.363
Grandma, I'm going to make it big on TV.

30:25.615 --> 30:27.200
You just wait and see.

30:27.743 --> 30:30.162
Of course. I'm so proud of you.

30:34.374 --> 30:38.211
My grandma always tells me
she's proud of me.

30:39.838 --> 30:41.381
But whenever I hear that,

30:42.007 --> 30:44.551
it makes me feel small
for some odd reason.

30:46.511 --> 30:49.264
I'm just a burden of a granddaughter
who can't let go

30:49.348 --> 30:51.391
of a dream that will never come true.

30:51.475 --> 30:53.560
What is there to be proud of?

30:53.643 --> 30:57.314
How has she made it this far
without earning any real money?

30:58.774 --> 31:01.026
What a pitiful diary.

31:01.109 --> 31:04.780
She wrote down every trivial detail,
as if it were something to be proud of.

31:06.073 --> 31:09.785
No wonder every bastard she meets
tries to walk all over her.

31:14.831 --> 31:17.876
SLEEP IS FOR THE DEAD

31:17.959 --> 31:18.960
THE FUTURE LEADING LADY

31:19.044 --> 31:20.087
YOU WILL BECOME A STAR

31:20.170 --> 31:22.172
I WILL GIVE MY GRANDMA A GOOD LIFE

31:23.965 --> 31:25.509
I'm so proud of you.

31:52.202 --> 31:54.579
A peony, beaded with dewdrops
like pearls, was plucked

31:54.663 --> 31:56.623
by a beauty as she passed a window.

31:57.582 --> 31:59.000
No flower in the world

31:59.084 --> 32:01.545
could be as beautiful as you.

32:03.296 --> 32:05.882
"Royal Consort Hui of the Kang clan,
of the Inner Court,

32:05.966 --> 32:08.218
has committed a heinous crime."

32:08.718 --> 32:11.763
Royal Consort Hui shall come forth
and receive the royal command!

32:15.684 --> 32:17.102
They say

32:18.728 --> 32:20.814
no blossom endures its bloom forever.

32:27.863 --> 32:29.030
The Three Obediences.

32:30.240 --> 32:31.616
Obey your father.

32:32.242 --> 32:33.827
Obey your husband.

32:34.619 --> 32:37.289
And obey your son.
That is what is expected of women.

32:37.372 --> 32:38.874
Rather than clinging pitifully

32:39.458 --> 32:42.252
to a wretched life with no one to rely on,

32:42.335 --> 32:44.963
perhaps death would be…

32:45.547 --> 32:46.798
Better, my foot!

32:46.882 --> 32:49.009
Even if I am wallowing in dog crap,

32:49.092 --> 32:50.677
life is better than death.

32:51.553 --> 32:52.846
So in this life,

32:52.929 --> 32:55.098
I will do what I must to survive it.

32:56.099 --> 32:58.268
That will also be how I honor the one

32:59.144 --> 33:00.770
to whom this body truly belongs.

33:36.431 --> 33:38.934
I will tell you all about it,
so try not to doze off

33:39.017 --> 33:40.977
and listen well.

33:43.146 --> 33:44.981
Whenever foreign enemies invaded,

33:45.065 --> 33:48.026
the people always stepped up
to fight before anyone else.

33:48.693 --> 33:50.487
-If they had no guns, they used swords.
-Gosh.

33:50.570 --> 33:53.240
If they had no swords, they used rocks.

33:55.158 --> 33:57.035
The country did nothing for them,

33:57.577 --> 33:59.913
yet they still sacrificed
their precious lives.

34:00.539 --> 34:01.414
Meanwhile,

34:01.498 --> 34:04.417
due to treaties signed by a few traitors,

34:04.501 --> 34:06.711
the country lost its sovereignty!

34:06.795 --> 34:09.297
Those traitors deserve
to be torn limb from limb!

34:09.381 --> 34:11.508
They should be torn to pieces!

34:15.762 --> 34:17.847
Long live Korean Independence!

34:17.931 --> 34:20.350
Long live Korean Independence!

34:20.433 --> 34:22.936
-Long live Korean Independence!
-Long live Korean Independence!

34:23.019 --> 34:25.272
Long live Korean Independence.

34:27.065 --> 34:29.401
Long live Korean Independence!

34:29.484 --> 34:30.694
Long live!

34:30.777 --> 34:31.987
Long live Korean Independence!

34:32.070 --> 34:34.573
Long live Korean Independence!

34:34.656 --> 34:36.157
Long live!

34:37.617 --> 34:39.411
Republic of Korea!

34:41.037 --> 34:43.039
Hey! Hey, everyone!

34:43.123 --> 34:44.249
Everyone, come out!

34:44.332 --> 34:46.084
Come on, everybody!

34:46.793 --> 34:49.254
Did you see the miracle
of the Red Devils?

34:49.337 --> 34:51.506
We made the semifinals! The semifinals!

34:51.590 --> 34:53.425
Republic of Korea!

34:55.802 --> 34:57.679
What's her deal?
The semifinals were ages ago.

34:57.762 --> 35:00.724
DAEBAK BOARDING HOUSE

35:00.807 --> 35:02.475
Curse this wretched fate of mine.

35:03.268 --> 35:06.104
I am stuck here washing clothes
like some lowly servant.

35:06.187 --> 35:07.731
Curse this fate.

35:28.918 --> 35:30.295
What the… blood!

35:32.797 --> 35:35.383
There are rats everywhere I go.

35:36.259 --> 35:37.135
Did you see that?

35:37.761 --> 35:39.721
She just threw that bat at his head.

35:39.804 --> 35:41.514
That was amazing.

35:56.738 --> 35:57.864
SHIN SEO-RI

35:59.366 --> 36:01.409
To the one coveting my side dishes,

36:01.493 --> 36:03.203
I cast a death curse last night.

36:03.286 --> 36:06.873
If you wish to avoid an untimely death,
return it to its rightful place.

36:06.956 --> 36:08.124
Death curse, my foot.

36:08.667 --> 36:10.377
Pork collar and jowl, here I come.

36:11.628 --> 36:12.962
Got you now.

36:13.046 --> 36:14.172
I knew it was you.

36:15.507 --> 36:17.175
The containers look similar.

36:17.258 --> 36:18.760
I just got confused for a second.

36:18.843 --> 36:20.845
See. They all look alike.

36:21.471 --> 36:23.515
Are your eyes attached to your feet?

36:23.598 --> 36:25.725
Or are you just completely illiterate?

36:26.434 --> 36:29.396
My name is clearly written on it.
How dare you feign ignorance?

36:29.479 --> 36:31.940
-What's going on?
-He got caught stealing side dishes.

36:32.023 --> 36:35.151
Did he steal
my leftover jokbal and whelk too?

36:35.235 --> 36:37.278
What's wrong with you all?
Do you have any proof?

36:37.362 --> 36:38.488
Do you?

36:38.571 --> 36:39.739
Don't point fingers.

36:39.823 --> 36:41.491
I can't believe this.

36:43.201 --> 36:44.828
Now that I have caught the rat,

36:44.911 --> 36:47.288
you may all rest easy
and partake of your meal.

36:47.372 --> 36:48.707
Amazing.

36:48.790 --> 36:51.751
Unit 203 just caught
the rooftop pervert too!

36:51.835 --> 36:55.296
She threw that laundry bat
like a shot put.

36:55.380 --> 36:57.048
I saw the whole thing.

37:01.177 --> 37:03.513
No need.
I did nothing to merit such fuss.

37:10.228 --> 37:12.188
BEST WISHES ON YOUR OPENING
CHOI MUN-DO, CHAIL E&amp;C

37:13.898 --> 37:15.066
Hey.

37:15.817 --> 37:16.693
Jeong-hyeon.

37:17.694 --> 37:18.862
Congratulations.

37:19.612 --> 37:21.865
I should've come by sooner.
That was thoughtless of me.

37:21.948 --> 37:25.118
Thoughtless? You sent a plant
and even some cash.

37:25.201 --> 37:27.620
I shamelessly
and happily accepted them.

37:27.704 --> 37:29.998
I thought you were only good
at caring for people,

37:30.081 --> 37:31.958
but you're good with plants too.

37:32.041 --> 37:33.835
Then again,
you've always been very attentive.

37:33.918 --> 37:36.629
You even put up
with someone as finicky as Se-gye.

37:38.590 --> 37:40.467
How is Se-gye doing these days?

37:55.106 --> 37:57.150
A plant? That's so not him.

37:57.233 --> 37:58.526
-Cash would've been better.
-Yeah.

37:58.610 --> 38:00.653
He gave me some cash, too. Mun-do.

38:01.196 --> 38:03.031
A cash gift for the clinic opening.

38:03.114 --> 38:04.199
Nothing in life is free.

38:04.282 --> 38:06.451
Free money always comes
with a high interest rate.

38:06.534 --> 38:08.787
Don't worry.
As if Mun-do would ever do that.

38:09.412 --> 38:11.289
Enough about me.
Let's go back to your story.

38:11.372 --> 38:13.249
-What story?
-About that weird woman.

38:13.333 --> 38:16.377
That woman in a shaman's hanbok
jumped in front of your car,

38:16.461 --> 38:18.671
showed up at your company,
predicted that attack,

38:18.755 --> 38:20.381
and she even offered to protect you?

38:20.465 --> 38:22.175
What do you think her deal is?

38:22.926 --> 38:26.387
She's really getting on my nerves.
Like a splinter under my fingernail.

38:26.471 --> 38:28.681
Paranoia. Are you getting
enough sleep these days?

38:28.765 --> 38:31.518
You know.
I had this weird dream the other day.

38:31.601 --> 38:33.436
-Some woman appeared in it.
-Who?

38:33.520 --> 38:35.104
I woke up before I saw her face.

38:35.188 --> 38:38.441
But you know,
some of it actually made sense.

38:39.108 --> 38:42.278
I was sleeping in a palace courtyard
in the middle of the day.

38:42.362 --> 38:44.906
That would mean I was someone
of some standing, right?

38:44.989 --> 38:47.951
So you're saying
you were a royal in your dream?

38:48.034 --> 38:49.619
Should I buy a lotto ticket?

38:49.702 --> 38:51.621
I feel like it had
some sort of hidden meaning.

38:51.704 --> 38:52.997
No hidden meaning. Just a dream.

38:53.081 --> 38:55.917
Stop chasing women in your dreams
and meet one in real life.

38:56.000 --> 38:58.670
Damn it, why do you always end up there?

38:58.753 --> 39:00.755
You just don't understand yet.

39:01.256 --> 39:02.632
Love is the best medicine.

39:03.758 --> 39:06.469
It's like a powerful shot of oxytocin.

39:06.553 --> 39:07.679
Best medicine, my ass.

39:08.847 --> 39:10.139
You quack.

39:15.645 --> 39:17.939
NEWTUBE
ROYAL CONSORT HUI OF THE KANG CLAN

39:25.697 --> 39:26.865
Okay.

39:26.948 --> 39:28.408
The master of palace intrigue.

39:28.491 --> 39:31.494
How did she get caught up
in all that palace intrigue?

39:31.578 --> 39:32.829
The gangster royal consort.

39:32.912 --> 39:34.539
The truth behind the poison refill.

39:36.207 --> 39:38.710
What do these young punks know?

39:40.628 --> 39:41.671
Damn it.

39:45.758 --> 39:47.385
I should just eat.

39:51.055 --> 39:53.182
He still has not learned his lesson yet?

39:53.975 --> 39:55.602
Stealing side dishes again?

39:57.645 --> 39:59.022
He deserves to die in his sleep.

40:00.607 --> 40:05.320
Unit 203 is really laying down the law
and asserting her authority.

40:07.363 --> 40:08.531
There's no kimchi either.

40:16.331 --> 40:17.457
Hold on.

40:17.957 --> 40:20.919
Should he not have sent word by now?

40:24.756 --> 40:25.924
Forget it.

40:26.007 --> 40:29.469
That degenerate treats me like I am a spy.
He can die for all I care.

40:35.642 --> 40:36.893
Love is the best medicine.

40:36.976 --> 40:39.312
It's like a powerful shot of oxytocin.

40:39.395 --> 40:41.564
Medicine? More like poison.

40:55.954 --> 40:57.163
Cha Se-gye!

40:59.540 --> 41:02.293
Unhand me, you damned brutes!

41:02.377 --> 41:03.711
What are you doing back here?

41:05.630 --> 41:07.215
Damn it.

41:08.299 --> 41:11.177
So, have you considered my proposal?

41:11.260 --> 41:12.512
What proposal?

41:12.595 --> 41:14.847
Oh, that ridiculous proposal
to protect me?

41:14.931 --> 41:15.807
That is right.

41:16.391 --> 41:18.226
I was unaware of your standing then

41:18.851 --> 41:20.812
and acted a bit imprudently.

41:20.895 --> 41:22.397
"A bit"?

41:22.480 --> 41:26.359
Perhaps… more than a bit.

41:26.442 --> 41:28.861
But now that I am fully aware
of your position,

41:29.362 --> 41:31.906
I know your need for my services is
all the more urgent.

41:31.990 --> 41:34.784
You claim to know me so well,
yet you barge in here so arrogantly?

41:34.867 --> 41:36.494
Have you forgotten already?

41:36.577 --> 41:38.705
I am the one who saved your life.

41:38.788 --> 41:40.832
The least you could do
is show eternal gratitude.

41:40.915 --> 41:42.583
You dare forsake your savior?

41:42.667 --> 41:44.085
Oh man. "Savior"?

41:45.253 --> 41:47.422
Stop spouting nonsense
about protecting me

41:47.505 --> 41:49.007
and just ask for money.

41:49.090 --> 41:50.591
The eye is just the mind, looking out.

41:50.675 --> 41:53.886
Perhaps you, who only sees me
as a money-grubber,

41:53.970 --> 41:55.555
are the one possessed by such a spirit.

41:56.556 --> 41:59.308
"Possessed" is a bit much.
Let's go with "CM."

41:59.392 --> 42:00.601
"See-em"?

42:01.561 --> 42:03.521
I have never heard of such a word.

42:04.022 --> 42:05.273
What does it mean?

42:05.356 --> 42:06.399
It means…

42:09.110 --> 42:12.238
Capitalist Monster. "CM."

42:12.989 --> 42:16.284
That is what I am.

42:16.993 --> 42:19.120
-A monster?
-Yeah, a monster.

42:19.746 --> 42:23.332
Simply put, I could easily chew up
and spit out a little greenhorn like you.

42:24.417 --> 42:28.087
So before things get ugly,
you should get out of here.

42:35.928 --> 42:36.971
Why, you little scoundrel!

42:39.140 --> 42:42.643
Ungrateful degenerate. Have you no grace
for those who show you concern?

42:42.727 --> 42:45.188
What do you think you're doing?
Are you insane?

42:45.271 --> 42:46.773
Don't just stand there! Drag her out!

42:46.856 --> 42:48.149
What the--

42:48.232 --> 42:49.734
Stop right there!

42:49.817 --> 42:51.319
Do not flee from me!

42:51.402 --> 42:53.404
Do you think you are invincible?

42:53.488 --> 42:55.782
If you do not value your life,
you will meet an early end!

42:55.865 --> 42:57.575
Assassins do not rest

42:57.658 --> 42:59.702
once a target has eluded them!

43:00.495 --> 43:01.996
Damn it.

43:02.080 --> 43:04.540
It is not working.
He is one wicked creature.

43:05.166 --> 43:06.626
As wicked as can be.

43:08.920 --> 43:11.547
Damn it, she's clinging on
like some kind of vengeful ghost.

43:11.631 --> 43:15.218
She's trying to use this fender bender
to change her entire lot in life.

43:15.301 --> 43:17.470
This is all you could get on Shin Seo-ri?

43:18.304 --> 43:20.431
How can someone's life be summed up
in less than a page?

43:20.515 --> 43:23.142
I looked into her further,
but that was all I could find.

43:23.226 --> 43:25.520
She experienced a brief flash
of fame as a child actor,

43:25.603 --> 43:27.438
but no one recognized her
as an adult.

43:27.522 --> 43:29.690
Perpetually stuck
between rookie and nobody, so to speak.

43:29.774 --> 43:32.151
"Nation's Pebble"? Please.
More like a chunk of gravel.

43:32.235 --> 43:34.237
Poor educational background,

43:34.320 --> 43:36.948
a tragic family history,
and a string of part-time jobs…

43:38.199 --> 43:39.283
It all makes sense now.

43:39.367 --> 43:42.120
It does look like that on paper,
but strangely enough, in person,

43:42.203 --> 43:44.497
she doesn't seem like the type
to have any ulterior motive.

43:44.580 --> 43:46.999
She really did seem
genuinely worried about you.

43:47.083 --> 43:50.169
They say it's easier to map the seafloor
than it is to map a person's intentions

43:50.253 --> 43:51.504
for a reason.

43:51.587 --> 43:53.422
Who knows when she'll show up
to cause a scene?

43:53.506 --> 43:55.508
-Keep security as is.
-Yes, sir.

44:06.185 --> 44:08.688
He has his subordinate escort me
because he's worried about me,

44:08.771 --> 44:10.940
but to my face,
he treats me like a money-grubber.

44:11.023 --> 44:12.692
And why does he get
so close for no reason?

44:12.775 --> 44:15.695
I have never met someone
so two-faced in my lifetime.

44:16.362 --> 44:18.281
I see. Your first time.

44:18.364 --> 44:21.534
His life is in danger.
How can he remain so carefree?

44:22.535 --> 44:24.495
"Do not wait until it is too late to act."

44:24.579 --> 44:27.248
He will clearly need my help
sooner rather than later.

44:27.331 --> 44:30.501
Yes. I see, Your Majesty.

44:31.002 --> 44:31.878
Well…

44:32.503 --> 44:33.796
I did not say anything earlier

44:33.880 --> 44:36.591
because arguing about etiquette
from 300 years ago would be pointless.

44:36.674 --> 44:39.802
But technically, I am not "Your Majesty."
I am "Your Highness."

44:41.512 --> 44:43.514
Your Highness, Your Majesty, or whatever.

44:43.598 --> 44:45.349
What difference does it make?

44:45.433 --> 44:48.394
The class system was abolished
over a century ago anyway.

44:49.020 --> 44:51.689
From what I have seen,
that is not entirely true.

44:51.772 --> 44:54.567
The class system may be gone,
but inequality remains.

44:54.650 --> 44:55.776
This is a world in which

44:55.860 --> 44:58.279
the rich are able to exploit people
even easier, if anything.

44:58.362 --> 45:01.199
All right then.
That's enough of the Che Guevara speech.

45:01.991 --> 45:03.784
Tell me why you're here today.

45:05.244 --> 45:06.829
Since you asked,

45:07.538 --> 45:09.582
I shall speak with the utmost candor.

45:11.792 --> 45:13.920
I was hoping you could lend me some money.

45:14.003 --> 45:16.505
Seriously? You didn't even pay
for your last reading.

45:16.589 --> 45:18.883
And now… you're unbelievable.

45:18.966 --> 45:20.259
How much do you need?

45:21.385 --> 45:23.387
Just a modest amount for now.

45:24.847 --> 45:26.557
Let us start with 50 million won.

45:30.645 --> 45:32.480
Did you say 50 million won?

45:32.563 --> 45:36.192
Come on now. As if I would ever have
that much money just lying around.

45:36.692 --> 45:38.986
Hold on, you do not even have
that kind of pocket change?

45:39.070 --> 45:40.821
I hear houses cost
hundreds of millions now.

45:40.905 --> 45:43.407
That's exactly why I rent.

45:44.450 --> 45:45.952
You're unbelievable.

45:46.702 --> 45:49.413
Here, you can take that
to buy yourself a meal.

45:49.497 --> 45:51.999
Wait, hold on a minute.
No, that's the wrong one.

45:52.959 --> 45:53.960
Gosh.

45:55.127 --> 45:56.796
You are just as broke as I am.

45:57.713 --> 46:00.383
I will put this to good use
and pay you back.

46:04.929 --> 46:06.639
You're robbing a broke woman blind.

46:06.722 --> 46:08.975
Enough about me.
Let's go back to your story.

46:09.058 --> 46:11.352
-What story?
-About that weird woman.

46:11.435 --> 46:14.355
That woman in a shaman's hanbok
jumped in front of your car,

46:14.438 --> 46:17.024
showed up at your company,
predicted that attack,

46:17.108 --> 46:19.068
and she even offered to protect you?

46:19.151 --> 46:20.903
What do you think her deal is?

46:20.987 --> 46:24.490
She's really getting on my nerves.
Like a splinter under my fingernail.

46:24.991 --> 46:26.409
Paranoia.

46:26.492 --> 46:28.035
Are you getting enough sleep these days?

46:28.119 --> 46:29.078
You know.

46:29.161 --> 46:30.788
I had this weird dream the other day.

46:30.871 --> 46:32.581
Some woman appeared in it.

46:34.166 --> 46:36.961
And she even offered to protect you?

46:37.044 --> 46:38.921
What do you think her deal is?

46:39.005 --> 46:42.591
She's really getting on my nerves.
Like a splinter under my fingernail.

46:42.675 --> 46:43.884
There's a woman?

46:45.386 --> 46:46.637
Okay, start right there.

46:46.721 --> 46:50.349
You dare run your vile mouth
before a Senior First Rank Royal Consort!

46:50.433 --> 46:51.392
Seize her!

46:51.475 --> 46:54.270
She really brings those lines
to life, doesn't she?

46:54.353 --> 46:55.896
That's what you call real acting.

46:55.980 --> 46:58.149
Kids these days are so cookie-cutter.

46:58.232 --> 46:59.483
They're all academy-trained.

46:59.567 --> 47:00.568
Yes. Right.

47:00.651 --> 47:03.821
Babe, I've been in the editing room
for 48 hours straight.

47:03.904 --> 47:05.531
None of them has that hungry spirit.

47:05.614 --> 47:06.949
Should I kill this bastard?

47:07.033 --> 47:08.534
-Right?
-Yes, you bastard.

47:09.577 --> 47:10.619
What? "You bastard"?

47:12.038 --> 47:13.664
-Pardon?
-Have you gone insane?

47:13.748 --> 47:15.291
My apologies, sir.

47:15.374 --> 47:17.043
This little punk…

47:17.126 --> 47:18.753
Your director is speaking.

47:18.836 --> 47:22.256
Your eyes shouldn't be glazed over
like a dead fish. What's wrong with you?

47:23.174 --> 47:24.967
Did you hear a word I just said?

47:25.051 --> 47:26.135
Did you?

47:29.138 --> 47:31.015
Hey. Where are you going?

47:31.098 --> 47:32.558
Hey! Seriously?

47:33.059 --> 47:34.518
You serious, punk?

47:34.602 --> 47:36.187
You're staging a one-man protest.

47:36.270 --> 47:37.313
What's your goal?

47:37.396 --> 47:39.565
I stand here to call out
a production system

47:40.441 --> 47:41.901
that exploits not only crew like me

47:41.984 --> 47:44.945
but also uncredited stand-in actors,

47:45.029 --> 47:48.032
all in the name
of a director's artistic vision.

47:48.115 --> 47:50.743
You mentioned
you have video evidence prepared?

47:50.826 --> 47:51.744
Right.

47:51.827 --> 47:52.995
THE WOMEN'S KINGDOM, STAND-IN

47:54.372 --> 47:55.706
I just uploaded it.

47:55.790 --> 47:57.958
I will leave it to the public to judge!

48:04.924 --> 48:08.260
Tae-woo, why aren't you answering?

48:08.761 --> 48:09.804
Are you sick?

48:09.887 --> 48:11.013
You better reply soon!

48:11.097 --> 48:12.515
Oh my god! Ji-hyo!

48:12.598 --> 48:13.974
You really need to see this.

48:14.058 --> 48:15.476
I think this may be your friend.

48:15.559 --> 48:18.270
What is it now? A dating rumor?

48:18.354 --> 48:20.898
You know your stand-in
for Royal Consort Hui?

48:21.690 --> 48:22.900
Shin Seo-ri? What about her?

48:22.983 --> 48:24.735
They're calling it
the Royal Consort Hui Meme.

48:24.819 --> 48:26.112
It's blowing up online.

48:26.195 --> 48:27.655
I think it's her.

48:27.738 --> 48:28.614
Let me see.

48:28.697 --> 48:29.782
You dare run your vile mouth

48:29.865 --> 48:31.867
before a Senior First Rank Royal Consort!

48:31.951 --> 48:33.327
You! You!

48:33.411 --> 48:34.870
You dare run your vile mouth!

48:34.954 --> 48:36.122
You! You! You!

48:36.205 --> 48:37.998
You! You! You! You! You!

48:38.082 --> 48:40.209
You! Dare! You! Dare! You! Dare!

48:40.292 --> 48:41.836
You dare run your vile mouth!

48:41.919 --> 48:43.254
You! You! You!

48:43.337 --> 48:45.005
You! You! You! You! You!

48:45.089 --> 48:46.132
You!

48:47.550 --> 48:48.968
You dare run your vile mouth!

48:49.051 --> 48:50.761
You dare run your vile mouth!

48:52.179 --> 48:54.682
-You dare run your vile mouth!
-You dare run your vile mouth!

48:54.765 --> 48:57.351
-You dare run your vile mouth!
-You! You! You!

48:57.435 --> 48:59.061
You! You! You! You! You!

48:59.145 --> 49:00.146
You!

49:00.855 --> 49:02.314
Her again?

49:03.816 --> 49:05.734
According to our findings,

49:05.818 --> 49:08.446
a crew member uploaded
the original video in an attempt

49:08.529 --> 49:10.030
to expose an abusive director.

49:10.114 --> 49:12.908
But when a YouTuber
with a million subscribers

49:12.992 --> 49:14.869
edited the clip, it went viral.

49:14.952 --> 49:17.037
The Planning Team suggests
we capitalize on this hype

49:17.121 --> 49:19.415
and integrate it
into our new promotion strategy.

49:19.498 --> 49:21.584
You want us to hire her
as our spokesperson?

49:21.667 --> 49:24.837
Yes, we plan to tailor
the approach for each channel.

49:24.920 --> 49:26.589
I'm scrapping that strategy.

49:27.465 --> 49:29.717
I'm sure you're all aware
that ahead of this launch,

49:29.800 --> 49:31.886
we've secured convertible bonds
from Kaiserman Capital

49:31.969 --> 49:33.512
as part of their investment conditions.

49:33.596 --> 49:35.097
Which means

49:35.181 --> 49:39.351
we need to make an aggressive push
into the market from the start.

49:39.435 --> 49:40.811
I suggest you report back

49:41.937 --> 49:43.314
with a revised plan.

49:53.282 --> 49:55.201
Such a sweet aroma.

49:56.327 --> 49:59.538
My good man,
what do you call this confection?

49:59.622 --> 50:01.749
They're called Doli Manjoos.
Would you like a bag?

50:09.381 --> 50:11.884
-Here you go.
-Thank you.

50:46.043 --> 50:49.964
GEONSAN MARKET

50:50.047 --> 50:52.716
A taste that could shake heaven and earth.

50:52.800 --> 50:54.593
My palate is ablaze.

50:54.677 --> 50:55.636
Delectably sweet.

51:01.433 --> 51:02.393
So cold!

51:02.476 --> 51:05.479
They consume this precious ice
without a care in the world?

51:17.908 --> 51:20.244
If I ate this carelessly in Joseon,

51:20.327 --> 51:24.582
I would get 30 lashes of the rod,
and my buttocks would be left in tatters.

51:24.665 --> 51:26.500
To think I can indulge
in such luxurious yakgwa

51:26.584 --> 51:27.501
to my heart's content.

51:27.585 --> 51:29.587
What a wonderful world to live in!

51:30.713 --> 51:31.589
Rice cake!

51:33.090 --> 51:34.174
You don't have money?

51:34.925 --> 51:37.344
My goodness. Just take it.

51:37.428 --> 51:38.929
-Thank you.
-Sure.

51:41.432 --> 51:44.602
Did I have a hole in my pocket?
Where did it all go?

51:45.936 --> 51:48.105
I have been possessed by a sweet demon.

51:51.358 --> 51:52.610
In this place,

51:53.319 --> 51:56.488
it seems even breathing
causes money to drain away.

51:56.572 --> 51:59.783
The four-class hierarchy
should be strictly observed,

52:00.701 --> 52:02.494
but what choice do I have?

52:02.578 --> 52:04.079
If I wish to avoid starving,

52:04.747 --> 52:06.915
I need to roll up my sleeves and work.

52:12.713 --> 52:14.840
LOOKING FOR PART-TIMERS
MOGU COFFEE

52:16.759 --> 52:18.719
Now that I have made up my mind,

52:18.802 --> 52:21.597
there will be no shortage
of people seeking me out.

52:22.890 --> 52:24.683
That worries me even more.

52:28.145 --> 52:29.396
I have arrived!

52:30.064 --> 52:31.732
You have store management experience?

52:31.815 --> 52:33.150
I once commanded

52:33.692 --> 52:36.362
a retinue of some 500 women.

52:38.238 --> 52:39.782
For such minor insubordination,

52:39.865 --> 52:43.494
a light flogging should bring them
under control in less than 30 minutes.

52:44.495 --> 52:45.788
May I ask how old you are?

52:45.871 --> 52:49.041
I am old enough
to have children in school.

52:49.124 --> 52:50.876
But I remain unmarried in this life.

52:50.959 --> 52:52.127
Excuse me?

52:53.003 --> 52:54.254
Do you have any other skills?

52:54.338 --> 52:56.298
Hunting down assassins.
Eradicating swindlers.

52:56.382 --> 52:59.134
With the secret arts I have acquired
through my own study,

52:59.218 --> 53:01.720
inducing a stomach ailment
is well within my power.

53:04.390 --> 53:05.474
Get out of here.

53:05.557 --> 53:07.851
Just my damn luck.
As if slow business weren't bad enough!

53:07.935 --> 53:09.687
Go! Get out of here.

53:10.187 --> 53:12.648
I should have you torn from limb to limb.

53:13.315 --> 53:15.275
How dare you throw salt in my presence!

53:16.902 --> 53:17.778
You scoundrel!

53:17.861 --> 53:21.365
You should be begging on your knees
for forgiveness if you bump into someone.

53:24.952 --> 53:27.871
Where is he off to in such a hurry,
bolting away like that?

53:37.881 --> 53:40.718
Surely there must be a place
that requires my talents.

53:41.593 --> 53:42.886
In a world this vast?

53:42.970 --> 53:45.180
I do not doubt it.

53:45.973 --> 53:46.932
Right?

53:47.474 --> 53:51.228
Mr. Cha. I can already feel
this will be a hit.

53:51.311 --> 53:53.355
In cosmetics,
your launch image is everything.

53:53.439 --> 53:56.191
-Spokesperson?
-That is the biggest challenge.

53:56.275 --> 53:57.901
As latecomers to herbal cosmetics,

53:57.985 --> 54:00.612
we need aggressive marketing
to generate hype.

54:00.696 --> 54:01.572
Oh right.

54:01.655 --> 54:03.532
Speaking of hype,
there's that new viral one.

54:03.615 --> 54:05.826
You must have seen it.
The possession meme.

54:05.909 --> 54:06.785
Possession meme?

54:06.869 --> 54:08.120
Come on, you know.

54:08.203 --> 54:10.205
"You dare run your vile mouth!"

54:10.289 --> 54:11.832
That Royal Consort Hui possession meme.

54:11.915 --> 54:14.042
My friend is MJ's ad team lead,

54:14.126 --> 54:17.880
and they're going crazy trying to find
that possessed girl's identity.

54:17.963 --> 54:19.548
-Is that so?
-It's totally viral.

54:19.631 --> 54:21.008
Can't you just picture it?

54:21.091 --> 54:23.469
Have her hold a drumstick and go, "You!"

54:23.552 --> 54:24.928
Fried chicken, sold out.

54:25.012 --> 54:27.681
Have her hold a lipstick and go, "You!"
Lipstick, sold out.

54:27.765 --> 54:28.766
Boom, clap, clap!

54:34.313 --> 54:35.814
Let us see how well you do

54:35.898 --> 54:38.442
after failing to recognize
a top-tier talent like me.

54:41.320 --> 54:42.488
Damn it.

54:42.571 --> 54:43.489
Damn you.

54:43.572 --> 54:45.783
Why are you lashing out
at someone else's flyer?

54:45.866 --> 54:47.367
I just put those up the other day.

54:47.451 --> 54:49.244
Why are you picking a fight
with me, thief?

54:49.328 --> 54:50.954
Cease your babbling and begone!

54:51.038 --> 54:52.080
"Thief"?

54:53.499 --> 54:55.501
Looks like you got rejected for a job.

54:56.001 --> 54:58.545
With a temper like that,
who would put you on their payroll?

54:58.629 --> 55:00.130
And what is wrong with my temper?

55:00.214 --> 55:01.507
Why would they not hire me?

55:01.590 --> 55:04.760
No one will hire someone who throws
tantrums when things don't go their way.

55:04.843 --> 55:06.220
First thing, you can't be late…

55:07.888 --> 55:10.390
Where are you running off to?
Are you going to get paid?

55:10.474 --> 55:11.391
Stop following me!

55:13.685 --> 55:15.604
-Stop right there!
-You stop!

55:21.527 --> 55:23.987
-Welcome to our summer special.
-Welcome.

55:24.071 --> 55:26.824
As you prepare for your summer vacation,

55:26.907 --> 55:29.368
I know many of you are concerned
about arm and belly fat.

55:29.451 --> 55:31.328
-That's right.
-Now, you can indulge

55:31.411 --> 55:33.080
and still stay on track with your diet.

55:33.163 --> 55:36.250
Today on our program, we have
Sriracha chicken breasts for you!

55:36.333 --> 55:38.585
Yes, that's right. Seeing is believing.

55:38.669 --> 55:40.295
We have mukbang hosts in the studio today.

55:40.379 --> 55:42.130
-Let's see what they're up to.
-Shall we?

55:44.049 --> 55:45.300
Wow.

55:48.762 --> 55:51.765
I get to eat chicken for free
and get paid for it?

55:51.849 --> 55:54.017
Who knew such merrymaking existed?

55:54.101 --> 55:55.561
I can't believe you followed me here.

55:55.644 --> 55:57.354
You're only making money because of me.

55:57.437 --> 55:59.439
So stop bullying me
at the boarding house already.

56:00.065 --> 56:02.609
And stop telling the others
to bang on my walls!

56:06.905 --> 56:09.825
I wondered why you were so quick
to arrange this job for me.

56:09.908 --> 56:12.661
You had an ulterior motive all along.

56:12.744 --> 56:13.954
Do not worry.

56:14.037 --> 56:17.332
I hold on to my grudges,
but I hold on to kindness even tighter.

56:17.416 --> 56:18.709
Have you forgotten already?

56:18.792 --> 56:20.294
I am the one who saved your life.

56:20.377 --> 56:22.296
The least you could do
is show eternal gratitude.

56:22.379 --> 56:23.714
You dare forsake your savior?

56:23.797 --> 56:25.757
Oh man. "Savior"?

56:25.841 --> 56:29.136
Unlike some people, I would never treat
my savior like a stray mutt.

56:29.219 --> 56:30.262
You may rest easy.

56:30.345 --> 56:32.431
-Who are you talking about?
-Just a scoundrel I know.

56:32.514 --> 56:34.099
Let us put the past behind us

56:34.182 --> 56:36.810
and start anew like respectable gentlemen.

56:36.894 --> 56:38.103
Huzzah!

56:39.313 --> 56:40.439
Huzzah!

56:42.858 --> 56:44.318
You miss what's right under your nose.

56:44.401 --> 56:47.362
I thought it'd blow over quickly,
but that buzz is lasting.

56:47.446 --> 56:48.780
The marketing team checked,

56:48.864 --> 56:51.909
and she's been trending at the top
of portal search algorithms for two weeks.

56:51.992 --> 56:55.120
Turns out that crazy woman wasn't a spy.
She was a hidden gem.

56:55.704 --> 56:56.747
No point in delaying it.

56:56.830 --> 56:57.706
Mr. Son.

56:58.290 --> 57:00.584
You should head out.
We need to claim her first.

57:01.293 --> 57:03.295
I'm on my way, sir.

57:07.466 --> 57:09.426
I heard Choi discovered
a new sellout queen?

57:09.509 --> 57:11.136
I heard she's breaking sales records.

57:11.219 --> 57:12.846
Her aesthetic is like

57:12.930 --> 57:14.598
"noblewoman from the Joseon era."

57:14.681 --> 57:17.142
A kitchen knife lives
or dies by its sharpness.

57:17.225 --> 57:18.477
Yes, that's right.

57:18.560 --> 57:20.270
Oh, my. What's going on there?

57:25.651 --> 57:27.486
A game-changer for the kitchen!

57:27.569 --> 57:29.738
The undisputed king of the kitchen!

57:29.821 --> 57:32.366
The emperor of chopping!
The pride of Korean-made knives!

57:32.449 --> 57:34.201
The Sapphire Rose Knife!

57:34.284 --> 57:36.703
-And just like that, it's sold out!
-That's right!

57:36.787 --> 57:39.373
These knife skills, praised even
by the Royal Kitchen

57:39.456 --> 57:41.416
during my palace maid days,
have not dulled since.

57:41.500 --> 57:43.710
The Rhythm Chinese Workbook Package.

57:43.794 --> 57:46.254
This is all you need
to master Chinese in six months.

57:46.338 --> 57:48.173
"Even the longest journey
begins with one step."

57:48.256 --> 57:50.425
"No one was ever full
from the first spoonful."

57:50.509 --> 57:53.053
"One must press forward steadily,
stacking stones one by one."

57:53.136 --> 57:54.846
That's amazing!

57:54.930 --> 57:56.264
We're sold out!

57:56.348 --> 57:58.225
-Sold out!
-Sold out!

57:58.308 --> 57:59.559
CHINESE WORKBOOK PACKAGE
SOLD OUT

57:59.685 --> 58:01.645
Mastering the original
Romance of the Three Kingdoms

58:01.728 --> 58:02.771
has finally paid off.

58:02.854 --> 58:06.650
A NEW ME, A NEW START
CERONA C

58:22.249 --> 58:24.418
That is hectopascal-level energy for you.

58:24.501 --> 58:26.169
You were all surprised, weren't you?

58:26.253 --> 58:28.588
That is the power packed in every bottle.

58:28.672 --> 58:32.426
Vitality that makes you do backflips.
You must experience it for yourself.

58:32.509 --> 58:34.344
Everyone, I'm being told
we're already sold out.

58:34.428 --> 58:36.805
-We're sold out.
-We sold out!

58:36.888 --> 58:39.474
-Sold out!
-Sold out!

58:39.558 --> 58:43.437
When it comes to nimble footwork
and quick reflexes, none can match me.

58:44.021 --> 58:45.897
-Sold out!
-Sold out!

58:45.981 --> 58:47.733
ENERGY CERONA C
SOLD OUT

58:48.692 --> 58:50.861
Where did that woman come from?

58:50.944 --> 58:53.447
She's just an extra here for the day.

58:53.530 --> 58:55.824
They've sold through
this quarter's entire allocation.

58:55.907 --> 58:59.077
The calls are still coming in
even after the sold-out notice.

58:59.161 --> 59:00.787
Contact the supplier. Get more stock.

59:00.871 --> 59:02.914
We have to strike while the iron is hot.

59:04.082 --> 59:06.752
Sir, Ms. Shin isn't picking up her phone.

59:07.252 --> 59:09.755
She couldn't already be
in talks with someone else, right?

59:09.838 --> 59:12.382
You need to hurry.
Find the "Nation's Gravel" or whatever.

59:12.466 --> 59:15.302
We must sign her
before anyone else finds out.

59:15.385 --> 59:17.804
Get her signature, or it'll be your head.

59:19.139 --> 59:20.724
Yes, sir.

59:32.861 --> 59:34.738
It won't take much time.

59:34.821 --> 59:37.324
You might as well do one more
since you're here anyway.

59:37.407 --> 59:38.325
Absolutely not.

59:38.408 --> 59:40.327
It is already past the agreed-upon time.

59:40.410 --> 59:41.703
I read in the paper

59:41.787 --> 59:44.873
that overwork is the shortcut
to every ailment known to man.

59:46.416 --> 59:48.627
Then I'll double your hourly wage.

59:48.710 --> 59:51.171
Double? We should do it.

59:52.047 --> 59:54.341
You treated me like some lowly maid
in the beginning.

59:54.424 --> 59:57.052
It appears you have
finally recognized my worth.

59:57.135 --> 59:58.053
In that case…

59:58.136 --> 59:59.554
-Seven times.
-What?

59:59.638 --> 01:00:02.265
For seven times the pay,
I shall gladly oblige.

01:00:02.349 --> 01:00:03.350
Wait, what?

01:00:04.392 --> 01:00:06.645
Are you nuts? Don't push it.

01:00:06.728 --> 01:00:09.439
We're not in a gambling den.
Don't try to hit the jackpot here.

01:00:09.523 --> 01:00:11.983
No more, no less. Exactly seven times.

01:00:12.859 --> 01:00:16.279
I mean, come on. Seven times the rate is--

01:00:16.363 --> 01:00:17.864
If you do not like it, look elsewhere.

01:00:17.948 --> 01:00:19.825
Wait. Hold on.

01:00:22.744 --> 01:00:24.412
Deal. Let's do it.

01:00:25.747 --> 01:00:27.624
Wait. That worked?

01:00:29.042 --> 01:00:30.127
Jesus.

01:00:30.669 --> 01:00:32.796
I feel like I've seen her
somewhere before.

01:00:33.421 --> 01:00:34.756
Where was it?

01:00:36.633 --> 01:00:40.595
You can find black goat extract documented
even in the Annals of the Joseon Dynasty.

01:00:40.679 --> 01:00:44.099
They say it was also the secret
to King Anjong's longevity.

01:00:44.182 --> 01:00:46.143
The timing could not be better.

01:00:46.226 --> 01:00:48.270
My vitality has worn considerably thin

01:00:48.353 --> 01:00:49.896
from this compulsory fasting.

01:00:49.980 --> 01:00:52.107
Looks like I will restore
my strength for free.

01:00:52.190 --> 01:00:53.358
You'll probably recognize her.

01:00:53.441 --> 01:00:55.986
She was recently crowned
the mukbang goddess.

01:00:56.069 --> 01:00:59.364
Shall we find out what she thinks
about our black goat extract?

01:00:59.447 --> 01:01:01.700
I'm with the mukbang goddess here.

01:01:01.783 --> 01:01:03.201
This is perfect

01:01:03.285 --> 01:01:06.163
for when you're feeling fatigued
and need an energy boost.

01:01:06.246 --> 01:01:07.289
Here we go.

01:01:09.875 --> 01:01:10.876
Oh, my.

01:01:13.837 --> 01:01:17.883
Medicine that's good for you
often has a bitter aroma.

01:01:18.633 --> 01:01:22.137
At times like this,
it's best to just gulp it down in one go.

01:01:22.220 --> 01:01:23.096
One big gulp.

01:01:23.180 --> 01:01:24.723
Hear me. Bring forth the poison.

01:01:24.806 --> 01:01:26.183
Let go!

01:01:26.266 --> 01:01:27.684
Let go!

01:01:31.563 --> 01:01:33.106
-Take it away!
-Oh no.

01:01:37.527 --> 01:01:41.281
As you can see, taking care
of your health is never easy.

01:01:41.364 --> 01:01:43.116
It requires patience.

01:01:43.200 --> 01:01:45.660
Please don't hang up your calls.

01:01:45.744 --> 01:01:47.162
It tastes perfectly fine.

01:01:47.787 --> 01:01:50.832
Because this is made
with 100% free-range black goat,

01:01:50.916 --> 01:01:52.626
there is nothing to worry about.

01:01:52.709 --> 01:01:54.628
Switch screens!

01:01:57.047 --> 01:01:59.174
You just threw up on live TV.
Are you insane?

01:01:59.257 --> 01:02:01.301
Are you trying to get me fired?

01:02:01.384 --> 01:02:04.346
Do you have any idea what you just did?

01:02:04.429 --> 01:02:05.639
You must know you messed up.

01:02:05.722 --> 01:02:07.849
"Royal Consort Hui of the Kang clan,
of the Inner Court,

01:02:07.933 --> 01:02:09.601
has committed a heinous crime."

01:02:09.684 --> 01:02:10.602
The villainess.

01:02:10.685 --> 01:02:13.480
With a wicked woman
manipulating the throne…

01:02:13.563 --> 01:02:16.191
She was disliked on a cataclysmic level.

01:02:16.274 --> 01:02:17.609
Royal Consort Hui…

01:02:17.692 --> 01:02:19.236
-So loud.
-Don't pretend to be sick.

01:02:19.319 --> 01:02:21.112
-Drop the act.
-Please stop.

01:02:21.196 --> 01:02:23.323
But that commoner's time will soon be up.

01:02:23.406 --> 01:02:26.493
Even the heavens take heed,
now that the wicked vixen is gone.

01:02:31.289 --> 01:02:33.166
I knew you were crazy from the start--

01:02:33.250 --> 01:02:34.626
Shut it!

01:02:34.709 --> 01:02:36.419
Shut that trap of yours!

01:02:37.128 --> 01:02:38.421
My head is pounding.

01:02:38.505 --> 01:02:40.090
"Shut my trap"? You can't be serious.

01:02:40.173 --> 01:02:42.133
You clung to me when you needed me,

01:02:42.801 --> 01:02:45.595
and now that I am no longer useful,
you cast me aside?

01:02:46.221 --> 01:02:48.807
You swallow what is sweet
and spit out what is bitter.

01:02:48.890 --> 01:02:50.600
That is what your despicable trap does!

01:02:50.684 --> 01:02:52.102
You have gone too far, lady.

01:02:52.185 --> 01:02:53.937
You must be insane.

01:02:54.020 --> 01:02:56.189
-How dare you!
-Why, you little…

01:02:57.732 --> 01:02:59.150
Damn it.

01:03:02.988 --> 01:03:04.572
Why, you little…

01:03:11.121 --> 01:03:12.289
Degenerate?

01:03:13.456 --> 01:03:14.624
Found you.

01:03:15.917 --> 01:03:17.043
Shin Seo-ri.

01:03:17.669 --> 01:03:20.130
We must sign her
before anyone else finds out.

01:03:20.213 --> 01:03:22.465
Get her signature, or it'll be your head.

01:03:30.432 --> 01:03:32.183
Found you.

01:03:40.900 --> 01:03:41.943
What are you doing here?

01:03:42.027 --> 01:03:43.862
I came looking for you.

01:03:44.362 --> 01:03:46.114
-Why?
-I have something to tell you.

01:03:46.698 --> 01:03:47.574
Come with me.

01:03:49.701 --> 01:03:51.953
You pop out of nowhere
and tell me to follow you?

01:03:52.037 --> 01:03:55.457
Would it not be a gentleman's duty
to explain the circumstances first?

01:03:55.540 --> 01:03:56.958
A gentleman's duty?

01:04:03.256 --> 01:04:05.300
You know you're really weird, right?

01:04:16.936 --> 01:04:18.938
We can talk about the details later.

01:04:39.459 --> 01:04:40.627
How…

01:04:41.336 --> 01:04:42.253
A kill list?

01:04:43.171 --> 01:04:46.299
It was obtained from an attendant
of His Majesty's quarters.

01:04:49.135 --> 01:04:53.348
ROYAL CONSORT HUI OF THE KANG CLAN

01:04:53.431 --> 01:04:55.600
The one holding a sword to my throat…

01:04:59.229 --> 01:05:00.563
was His Majesty.

01:05:18.581 --> 01:05:19.999
Go in peace.

01:05:27.215 --> 01:05:29.092
-Your Majesty.
-"Your Majesty"?

01:05:35.765 --> 01:05:37.267
Shin Seo-ri.

01:05:44.941 --> 01:05:48.111
What is His Majesty doing here?
Am I seeing things?

01:05:48.194 --> 01:05:52.449
Right. I must have seen an apparition
because I was feeling so dizzy.

01:05:52.532 --> 01:05:54.117
I must gather my wits about me.

01:05:54.200 --> 01:05:55.452
Shin Seo-ri.

01:05:58.455 --> 01:06:00.415
Why would you run away like that?

01:06:00.498 --> 01:06:03.460
Why did you follow me all the way here?

01:06:03.543 --> 01:06:05.044
I said I have something to tell you.

01:06:05.128 --> 01:06:06.087
What?

01:06:06.171 --> 01:06:08.798
Things look serious over there.

01:06:08.882 --> 01:06:09.966
Are they fighting?

01:06:10.049 --> 01:06:11.509
They're clearly not fighting.

01:06:11.593 --> 01:06:13.887
Looks like things are about to heat up.

01:06:13.970 --> 01:06:14.846
Ms. Shin Seo-ri.

01:06:16.097 --> 01:06:17.557
I'd like to offer you a contract.

01:06:17.640 --> 01:06:19.142
A contract?

01:06:19.851 --> 01:06:22.312
You made it clear
I had nothing to offer you.

01:06:22.395 --> 01:06:23.563
No, it turns out you do.

01:06:25.231 --> 01:06:26.649
I need that.

01:06:27.192 --> 01:06:30.195
And in turn, you. Desperately, even.

01:06:31.154 --> 01:06:32.155
You

01:06:32.780 --> 01:06:33.740
need me?

01:06:55.553 --> 01:06:58.389
Here you are.
I've been looking everywhere for you.

01:07:03.937 --> 01:07:04.812
That face…

01:07:07.565 --> 01:07:08.942
He is no apparition.

01:07:13.530 --> 01:07:14.822
What are you doing here?

01:07:22.580 --> 01:07:24.123
Degenerate.

01:07:25.416 --> 01:07:26.876
I am going to need you…

01:07:28.711 --> 01:07:30.421
to be my shield for a moment.

01:08:29.397 --> 01:08:32.692
MY ROYAL NEMESIS

01:08:34.193 --> 01:08:35.320
Help!

01:08:35.987 --> 01:08:37.655
Help me!

01:08:37.739 --> 01:08:38.906
Let me out!

01:08:40.533 --> 01:08:41.743
Let me out of here!

01:08:50.001 --> 01:08:51.210
Help…

01:08:52.420 --> 01:08:53.838
Please let me out.

01:08:54.380 --> 01:08:55.340
Help me.

01:08:55.423 --> 01:08:57.759
YEONGHWI CHAMBER

01:09:11.272 --> 01:09:12.148
Help…

01:09:13.232 --> 01:09:14.484
Please let me out.

01:11:03.676 --> 01:11:05.720
They say cursed ties bind deeper
than destined ones.

01:11:05.803 --> 01:11:07.513
When it feels off, it is best to avoid it.

01:11:07.597 --> 01:11:09.932
It's even more pathetic than I expected.

01:11:10.016 --> 01:11:11.851
Do not tell me you were tailing me.

01:11:11.934 --> 01:11:13.436
Our Se-gye has a woman in his life?

01:11:13.519 --> 01:11:15.480
Just an unknown actress. Nothing special.

01:11:15.563 --> 01:11:18.566
What about the ad campaign?
Can we proceed with Ms. Shin?

01:11:19.525 --> 01:11:21.736
-You were worried about me again.
-Worried? As if.

01:11:21.819 --> 01:11:24.655
Did you dream about a woman you know?
Your first love from a past life?

01:11:24.739 --> 01:11:26.491
"First love"? You've lost your damn mind!

01:11:26.574 --> 01:11:28.743
Let us keep it simple.
We shall just follow our gut.

01:11:28.826 --> 01:11:30.328
What a truly ridiculous woman.

01:11:32.205 --> 01:11:34.207
Subtitle translation by Justin S. Kim
